<title>CANADA: United Rayore seeks strategic alternatives.</title>
<headline>United Rayore seeks strategic alternatives.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Rayore Gas Ltd said on Tuesday that it retained FirstEnergy Capital Corp to evaluate strategic alternatives for the company to maximize shareholder value.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416-941-8100</p>
